Q22. Why do we plot loss?

Ans: To observe how the model's error decreases during training.

Q23. What happens when loss decreases?

Ans: The model is generally learning better.

Q24. What is validation accuracy?

Ans: Accuracy measured on separate validation data during training.

Q25. Which optimizer is used in this practical?

